4. O-O {King safety first.}
4... Be7 {Development.}
5. d3 {[%csl Ge4] Prepares e4.}
5... O-O {Castles.}
6. Nbd2 {[%cal Gd2e4] Supports the e4 break.}
6... c5 {[%csl Gc5] Black gains queenside space. In the KIA, Black attacks on the queenside and White on the kingside.}
7. e4 {[%cal Ge4d5] The thematic break.}
